I come out of the building.
Today is Sunday.
It is very quiet on the street.
I walk slowly.
I am a little sad.
I miss my family.
But I am also happy.
My mother and my father are in Mexico.
My little sister Sofia and my big brother Diego are also there.
Their happy voices are still in my mind.
I see a big tree ahead.
There is a dog under the tree.
He is sleeping.
I miss my Lola.
The breeze here is nice.
I take a deep breath.
This is my new street.
This is my new life.
Mumbai is my home now.
